  "title": "Easy Brownie Mix Cookies",
  "description": "These easy brownie cookies are fudgy, soft, and quick and simple to make with a box of brownie mix, chocolate chips, and a few pantry ingredients.",
  "authors": [
    "TrudyBear"
  ],
